---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl fade-in">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mb-6" style="color: #e8e8f0;">About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p data-ko="AI를 사용하고, 연구합니다." data-en="Using AI. Researching AI.">
        Using AI. Researching AI.
      </p>
      <p data-ko="최신 LLM 모델(Claude, Gemini, GPT 등)을 활용해 프로덕트를 만들고, 그 과정에서 얻은 인사이트를 기록합니다. AI의 빠른 발전 속에서 실제로 쓸 수 있는 정보만 정리합니다." data-en="Building products with the latest LLM models (Claude, Gemini, GPT, etc.) and documenting insights along the way. Curating only actionable information in the fast-moving AI landscape.">
        Building products with the latest LLM models (Claude, Gemini, GPT, etc.) and documenting insights along the way. Curating only actionable information in the fast-moving AI landscape.
      </p>
      <p data-ko="사주 앱, 트레이딩 봇, 커피챗 등 여러 프로젝트를 동시에 진행하고 있다. 진행 상황은 이 사이트에 빌드 로그로 쌓아둔다." data-en="Running multiple projects simultaneously — fortune telling app, trading bot, coffee chat, and more. Progress lands on this site as build logs.">
        Running multiple projects simultaneously — fortune telling app, trading bot, coffee chat, and more. Progress lands on this site as build logs.
      </p>
      <p data-ko="주요 LLM 모델 소식은 spoonai에 모아두고 메일로도 보낸다. Claude, Gemini, GPT 같은 변화를 천천히 따라간다." data-en="LLM news from Claude, Gemini, GPT and others is gathered on spoonai and sent out by email. A quiet way to follow the shifts.">
        LLM news from Claude, Gemini, GPT and others is gathered on spoonai and sent out by email. A quiet way to follow the shifts.
      </p>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <p>
        GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/jee599">github.com/jee599</a><br />
        Blog: <a href="https://dev.to/jee599">dev.to/jee599</a><br />
        Site: <a href="https://jidonglab.com">jidonglab.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
